### 相机供电控制API测试

### 1. 关闭相机供电
### 发送命令: A0 01 01 A2 (打开继电器，相机断电)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/relay/camera-power/off
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. 打开相机供电
### 发送命令: A0 01 00 A1 (关闭继电器，相机通电)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/relay/camera-power/on
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. 查询相机供电状态（设备不支持查询）
### 注意：此设备不支持状态查询，将返回未知状态
GET http://localhost:3000/api/relay/camera-power/status

### 5. 获取继电器串口连接状态
GET http://localhost:3000/api/relay/status

### 6. 测试继电器串口连接
GET http://localhost:3000/api/relay/test-connection

### 7. 测试不同的查询命令
### 测试1路查询命令 (A0 01 05 A6)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/relay/test-query?commandType=status

### 8. 测试1路开带反馈 (A0 01 03 A4)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/relay/test-query?commandType=status_with_feedback

### 9. 测试1路关带反馈 (A0 01 02 A3)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/relay/test-query?commandType=status_off_with_feedback

### 10. 测试1路取反 (A0 01 04 A5)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/relay/test-query?commandType=toggle

### 11. 测试2路查询 (A0 02 05 A7)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/relay/test-query?commandType=route2_query

### 12. 测试3路查询 (A0 03 05 A8)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/relay/test-query?commandType=route3_query

### 13. 测试4路查询 (A0 04 05 A9)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/relay/test-query?commandType=route4_query

### 14. 测试设备是否支持状态查询（综合测试）
GET http://localhost:3000/api/relay/test-device-support
